DO Resolve absolute project, ticket_path, and summary_path in active .inux. Require ticket.md;
    allow technical-summary.md to be missing. Never reset the task or synchronize pr.md.

DO Read full ticket.md and existing technical-summary.md together; retain ticket_id,
    saved_summary (NULL if missing), and Booleans summary_exists and summary_is_empty.
    Reject a supplied-ID mismatch or an existing summary identifying another ticket.

DO Set mode to "generate", "improve", or "publish" from the request. Accept /inux ts and
    /inux technical summary as aliases, create as generate, and refine as improve. Bare requests
    generate missing/empty summaries and otherwise improve them. Unclear intent gives NULL;
    never infer publication.

IF mode == NULL:
    ASK "Which technical-summary action do you want: generate, improve, or publish?" AS clarified_request

    DO Resolve mode from clarified_request and the original request; never infer publication.

CHECK mode is one of "generate", "improve", "publish".

IF mode == "generate":
    USE ts/generate.flow

IF mode == "improve":
    USE ts/improve.flow

IF mode == "publish":
    USE ts/publish.flow
